  <h2>Snooze</h2>
  <p>Snooze silences the underfunded reminder for a month without deleting the target. Auto-Assign skips a snoozed category. The target is still there when the snooze ends.</p>

  <h2>Auto-Assign</h2>
  <p>On the Budget tab, <strong>Auto-Assign</strong> can fill this month’s categories from the targets you set. The main action is one tap, and it opens a preview before anything changes. You still choose whether to apply it. Other actions sit beside that one.</p>
